1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:01,552
Hi Flora,

2
00:00:02,144 --> 00:00:06,288
Thanks for your email. To answer your question,

3
00:00:06,576 --> 00:00:08,784
my new school is great!

4
00:00:09,456 --> 00:00:11,136
It’s very beautiful.

5
00:00:11,776 --> 00:00:14,464
There are many modern buildings.

6
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:19,952
There’s a large sports field next to the teachers’ building.

7
00:00:20,896 --> 00:00:25,472
All the students go there and do exercises together in the morning.

8
00:00:26,208 --> 00:00:31,424
It’s amazing! Every Monday we raise the flag there.

9
00:00:32,448 --> 00:00:35,184
It’s a special way to start the week.

10
00:00:36,624 --> 00:00:40,032
The classroom building is behind the sports field.

11
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:44,048
We spend most of the time in our classroom.

12
00:00:44,816 --> 00:00:49,904
It’s big and clean. Every week, we change seats.

13
00:00:50,816 --> 00:00:55,104
This week I sit next to my best friend, Han Lin.

14
00:00:56,608 --> 00:00:59,568
The dining hall is across from the sports field.

15
00:01:00,192 --> 00:01:01,968
It’s my favourite place

16
00:01:02,192 --> 00:01:04,576
because there are many kinds of food.

17
00:01:05,376 --> 00:01:07,760
I love the Chinese food there.

18
00:01:08,448 --> 00:01:10,928
They make delicious jiaozi.

19
00:01:11,536 --> 00:01:13,152
How about your school?

20
00:01:13,664 --> 00:01:15,472
Yours,Peter

